#: accounts.cpp:45
msgid "Account Setup"
msgstr "Postava korisničkog računa"

#: accounts.cpp:66
msgid "Edit..."
msgstr "Promijeni..."

#: accounts.cpp:68
msgid "Allows you to modify the selected account"
msgstr "Dozvoljava vam da promjenite izabrani korisnički račun"

#: accounts.cpp:77
msgid "New..."
msgstr "Novi..."

#: accounts.cpp:81
msgid ""
"Create a new dialup connection\n"
"to the internet"
msgstr ""
"Napravi novu dial-up vezu\n"
"na Internet"

#: accounts.cpp:89
msgid ""
"Makes a copy of the selected account. All\n"
"settings of the selected account are copied\n"
"to a new account, that you can modify to fit your\n"
"needs"
msgstr ""
"Stvara kopiju izabranog korisničkog računa.\n"
"Sve postavke će biti kopirane u novi korisnički\n"
"račun koji možete prilagoditi svojim\n"
"potrebama."

#: accounts.cpp:99
msgid ""
"Deletes the selected account\n"
"\n"
"<red><b>Use with care!"
msgstr ""
"Briše izabrani korisnički račun\n"
"\n"
"<red><b>Koristite oprezno!</b></red>"

#: accounts.cpp:108
msgid "Phone Costs:"
msgstr "Telefonski troškovi:"

#: accounts.cpp:121
msgid ""
"This shows the accumulated phone costs\n"
"for the selected account.\n"
"\n"
"<b>Important</b>: If you have more than one \n"
"account - beware, this is <b>NOT</b> the sum \n"
"of the phone costs of all your accounts!"
msgstr ""
"Prikazuje kumulativne troškove\n"
"izabranog korisničkog računa.\n"
"\n"
"<b>Važno</b>:Ako imate više od jednog korisničkog\n"
"računa - oprez , ovo <b>NIJE<b> suma svih telefonskih\n"
"troškova za sve korisničke račune!"

#: accounts.cpp:128 conwindow.cpp:54
msgid "Volume:"
msgstr "Volumen:"

#: accounts.cpp:140
msgid ""
"This shows the number of bytes transferred\n"
"for the selected account (not for all of your\n"
"accounts. You can select what to display in\n"
"the accounting dialog.\n"
"\n"
"<link #volaccounting>More on volume accounting</link>"
msgstr ""
"Prikazuje broj prenesenih znakova za izabrani\n"
"korisnički račun (ne za sve vaše račune. Možete\n"
"izabrati što želite prikazati u dialogu korisničkih računa\n"
"\n"
"<link #volaccounting>Više o višestrukim korisničkim računima</link>"

#: accounts.cpp:152
msgid "Reset Costs"
msgstr "Poništi troškove"

#: accounts.cpp:158
msgid "View Logs"
msgstr "Pregledaj dnevnike"

#: accounts.cpp:224
msgid "Reset Total"
msgstr "Poništi ukupno"

#: accounts.cpp:225
msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to reset the accumulated\n"
"telephone costs for the selected account to zero?"
msgstr ""
"Jeste li sigurni da želite poništiti nakupljene\n"
"telefonske troškove za odabrani račun na nulu?"

#: accounts.cpp:259 accounts.cpp:280
msgid "Maximum number of accounts reached."
msgstr "Maksimalni broj korisničkih računa dosegnut."

#: accounts.cpp:286
msgid "No account selected."
msgstr "Nije izabran nijedan račun."

#: accounts.cpp:301
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to delete\n"
"the account \"%s\"?"
msgstr ""
"Jeste li sigurni da želite obrisati\n"
"račun \"%s\"?"

