#: runtests.cpp:364
msgid ""
"You´re not allowed to dial out with kppp.\n"
"Contact your system administrator."
msgstr ""
"Nemaš dozvolu za pokretanje kppa!\n"
"Kontaktiraj svog administratora sustava."

#: runtests.cpp:381
msgid ""
"This kernel has no PPP support, neither\n"
"compiled in nor via the kernel module\n"
"loader.\n"
"\n"
"To solve this problem:\n"
"  * contact your system adminstrator\n"
"or\n"
"  * install a kernel with PPP support\n"
msgstr ""
"Ova jezgra (kernel) nema PPP podršku uključenu\n"
"direktno ili preko modula.\n"
"\n"
"Da riješite ovaj problem\n"
"  * kontaktirajte svoga sistem administratora\n"
"ili\n"
"  * instalirajte jezgru s PPP podrškom\n"

#: runtests.cpp:412
msgid ""
"You do not have the permission\n"
"to start pppd!\n"
"\n"
"Contact your system administrator\n"
"and ask to get access to pppd."
msgstr ""
"Nemaš dozvolu za\n"
"pokretanje pppd-a!\n"
"\n"
"Kontaktiraj svog administratora sustava\n"
"i traži pristup pppd-u."

#: runtests.cpp:423 runtests.cpp:437
msgid ""
"pppd is not properly installed!\n"
"\n"
"The pppd binary must be installed\n"
"with the SUID bit set. Contact your\n"
"system administrator."
msgstr ""
"pppd nije instaliran dolično!\n"
"\n"
"pppd izvršni kod mora biti instaliran\n"
"sa postavljenim SUID bitom. Kontaktiraj svog\n"
"administratora sustava."

#: runtests.cpp:472
msgid ""
"kppp has detected a 'lock' option in /etc/ppp/options.\n"
"\n"
"This option has to be removed since kppp takes care of device locking "
"itself.\n"
"Contact your system administrator."
msgstr ""
"kppp je detektirao 'lock' opciju u /etc/ppp/options.\n"
"\n"
"Trebate ukloniti tu opciju budući da kppp sam vodi računa o zaključavanju "
"modema.\n"
"Molim kontaktirajte administratora sistema."

#: runtests.cpp:497
msgid ""
"is missing!\n"
"\n"
"Ask your system administrator to create\n"
"a non-empty file that has appropriate\n"
"read and write permissions."
msgstr ""
"nedostaje!\n"
"\n"
"Zamolite administratora da stvori\n"
"dotičnu datoteku i da je otvori za\n"
"čitanje svim korisnicima."

